WEBVTT

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.930
At last, the ring leader for
everything that's happened...

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.840
...Gaav, the Demon Dragon King,
appeared before us!

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:39.070
In the face of a merciless attack by
one of the highest-level Monsters...

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.130
...we were in a pretty tight pinch!

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:44.080
But, at the very last moment,
we were saved by Auntie Aqua...

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:48.080
...who was really the remaining thoughts
of the Water Dragon King given form.

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:50.620
Once you leave here,
head for the Katahto mountains!

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:53.310
To where the original
Claire Bible lies!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.670
I know we're supposed to be going
where Auntie Aqua told us to, but...

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:21.710
We don't know the way to the
Katahto mountains past this point.

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.940
Well, Xellos?

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:32.660
Figure anything out yet?

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.860
Yes, well...

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.970
As you can see, the giant mountains
which lay before this village...

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.770
...are definitely
the Katahto mountains.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.930
The problem is finding
a pass to get to them.

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:49.640
Why's that?

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.440
The knowledge of that path was
lost to humans centuries ago.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.450
Past this point, it all turns
into a natural labyrinth.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:59.350
A natural?! Ooh...

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:02.120
There's nothing worse than
trying to find your way through...

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.420
...a labyrinth that wasn't laid
out according to any plan!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.890
Why don't we just fly over
them like we usually do?

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:12.860
Uh, look, considering that Gaav can
be anywhere waiting to get us...

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:17.500
...just casually flying around is like
saying "Hello! Attack me, please!"

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:19.330
I see...

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:24.470
So I guess we'll need a local to
guide us through the forest.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:28.050
Well, it's one thing to say
that we need a local guide...

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:31.020
...but can we find someone
here with the guts to do it?

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:36.620
Well, we aren't getting
anywhere just standing around.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.890
Let's just try to get as
far along as we can.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.260
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:53.940
Ow, ow, ow... Darn it,
watch where you're running!

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.980
Oh! I... I'm sorry!

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:06.050
I'm sort of in a hurry.
Are you hurt, Miss?

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:10.720
Huh? Oh, no. It takes more
than this to hurt me! Really!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.920
I'm glad.
I'm really sorry. See you!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.140
A thief?! You mean...

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.610
A handsome little boy
like you is a villain?!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.440
Uh, well... You see...

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:37.380
Look out! Run away fast, kid!

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.010
That's right! If you
stay here, you're doomed!

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.690
It's too-o-o-o late!

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:55.000
C'mon, harder!

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:57.160
What's wrong with you?!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.930
Oh, come on! I didn't say you
could slack off or take a break!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:03.240
Now come on! Do it harder!

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:05.080
Hm... Not good enough!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.770
Harder!

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:11.290
You should be grateful this is
the worst Lina does to you, kid.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:13.340
Really. Even if he is a villain...

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:18.190
...I wouldn't want to see a kid as
young as he is get blasted by her.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.130
Is... Is she really
as bad as all that?

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.500
Ooh! There you go adding
to my bad reputation again!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:30.610
Considering how I'm known
as the "Bandit Killer"...

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.870
...I want to hear some thanks
for letting you off so easy!

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.610
I'm sorry...

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.870
But I want to get out of this
village more than anything!

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.250
And for that, I need money, so...

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.410
I guess so.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.250
You must hate being in such
a dead little village like this.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.260
It must be a pretty hard life.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:56.060
Well, too bad! This is what happens
when you don't work honestly!

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:58.400
You're wrong if you think you
can make easy money, pal!

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:01.630
Miss Lina...

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.040
You're the LAST
person who can say that!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.830
Oh, shut up!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:09.200
Anyway, you may be
of some use to us...

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:11.440
...so I'll make a deal with
you and give you the money.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.210
Do you agree?

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.940
Miss!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.040
H- Hey, Lina!
What are you planning?

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:22.120
You say you want to
get out of this village.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.250
Can I assume that means you
know a way through the forest?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.360
NOW I see.

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:30.420
The forest?
Where do you all want to go?

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:35.890
We are headed for Dragon's Peak,
which lies in the Katahto mountains!

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:38.270
Hey! She's stealing my act again.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:41.780
Dragon's Peak? Oh, in that case...

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:43.910
You know where it is?

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:48.980
Tell us! Tell us!
Tell us where it is!

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.970
We turn right here!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.560
Man, did we ever luck out!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:12.540
This map's really good!
I'm impressed by that kid!

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.980
Really! It's a good thing
he ran you down today!

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:23.010
Whew... Lina, shouldn't you have
asked the kid to guide us himself?

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:24.780
No, I shouldn't have.

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:28.720
We still don't know what's
waiting for us up ahead.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:32.750
Especially since we're headed
for a legendary valley...

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:37.060
...supposedly inhabited by
innumerable gold and black dragons.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:40.030
Dragons?!

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.800
Long ago, there were so many
dragons flying around there...

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:47.140
...the sky seemed to be
colored black and gold.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:52.710
That valley's pretty famous
in the Sorcerers' Guild records.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:56.510
That Dragon's Peak is in
the Katahto mountains?

00:07:56.820 --> 00:08:00.410
The Water Dragon King led us to
the valley where the dragons dwell...

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:02.920
And there can be only one
reason for all those dragons...

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.090
...to be living
in an ordinary valley.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.160
The Claire Bible's there!

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:09.990
I'd have to agree.

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:12.670
Okay, guys! Full speed ahead!

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:18.270
Uh, Claire Bible?
Oh! Hey, wait a second!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.930
You saw them, right?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.690
They keep leaving
me behind like this!

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:49.790
I won't forgive them! Master Xellos,
who toyed with my heart...

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:52.740
...and Lina, who ruined my life!

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.170
A flat-chested girl and a
man dressed all in black.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:01.180
They're demons looking for a
mysterious temple who only LOOK human!

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:03.650
Where did they go? Where?!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.090
Huh?! Um, well... That is...

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:11.220
I, of course, don't expect
you to tell me for free.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:16.320
If you lead me to Lina and the others,
I will reward you handsomely!

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.600
How would you like THIS?!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:26.000
Hm? That's funny... Where's the
money I earned as a waitress?

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:28.840
Huh? Oh, here it is! Wait...

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.450
Uh... Miss?

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:46.250
This is all Lina's fault!
I wanted to get back at her so much!

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.590
Oh, I can't stand this!

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.260
Incredible!

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.890
Lina! There really
are dragons here!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:28.060
Well? What are we
going to do now, Lina?

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.260
What will we do? Well...

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:32.200
I hadn't thought that far ahead.

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:42.040
That dragon's landing here!

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.980
A golden dragon. They're the
smallest of the dragon race but...

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:50.290
...their abilities are so exceptional
that they're known as the dragon lords.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.820
HUH?! That's a SMALL one?!

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:19.400
Uh, Lina...

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.440
Just be quiet, Gourry.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.480
What do you humans want here?

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.880
Did you just hear that?!
The dragon spoke!

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:33.520
He spoke...

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:37.390
Oh? Is it so strange to you
that a dragon can speak?

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:41.660
Well... It's just that I've never
heard a dragon speak before.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:44.890
But where did you
learn to speak human?

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.060
The dragon race
lives in eternity.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:54.470
As we cross the seas of time,
we learn the tongues of other races.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:59.250
So... You're saying you learn
languages to keep from getting bored!

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:02.540
Uh, well... I suppose
you could put it that way.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.390
Well, being able to talk
will speed this up a lot!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:10.050
Lina, tell this guy what's going on and
ask him to lead us where we're going!

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:11.750
This "guy"?!

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:15.390
Are you nuts?! You don't talk to
a dragon lord like that! Idiot...

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:20.200
Please don't take
Mr. Gourry seriously.

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:21.900
What'd I do?!

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.370
Such strange people...

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.050
It's been a long time, Milgasia...

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.480
Yes, it has been a long time.

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:42.390
I had hoped our paths
would never cross again...

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.560
...Beast Master Xellos.

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.230
What's going on, Xellos?

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.630
Do you know this dragon?!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.330
Yes. It was a
while ago, though...

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:55.670
I haven't seen your face since
the War of the Monsters' Fall.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.040
The War of the Monsters' Fall!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:02.540
Oh, man... No wonder this dragon
isn't happy to see him!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:05.710
Huh? What? What do you mean?

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:10.540
I have to explain what the War of the
Monsters' Fall was, jellyfish brains?!

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:16.720
According to legend, the dragons
and Monsters were enemies then!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.820
So, to a golden dragon
like Milgasia here...

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.920
...Xellos would be seen as an enemy!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:28.870
Monster's Fall? Xellos!
Umm... Hmm...

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.130
Forget it...

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:34.640
Well, then, what are you doing
in this valley, Beast Master?

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:38.800
The truth is, we have a need
for the Claire Bible here.

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:42.720
I was hoping you'd
let this girl here use it.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:45.380
Let a human use it?!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.610
What are you up to?

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:52.490
I'm not the one who's up to anything.
It's Lord Hellmaster that is.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:56.930
He hasn't told me what
his objective is, but...

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:01.470
Well, think of it as being the sad
duty of middle management.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.310
And what will you do if I say no?

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.080
Think of something
other than negotiation.

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:18.740
I see... If you want to do that,
we're in no position to stop you.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:22.090
Do as you wish. However...

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:40.270
I will be the one to take you to it.
Follow me.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.640
Hey! Lina!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:51.640
At last... At last, we're going!
To the true Claire Bible!

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:58.920
Miss! Turn right at the next grove!

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:01.120
Right? All right!

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.930
Just you wait, Lina!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.690
I'll be the one who
gets the Claire Bible!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:11.070
Oh, what are you doing?!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.370
If we don't hurry,
Lina will beat us!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.680
Here, let me see that.

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:20.870
Miss...

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.050
A young boy like
you couldn't understand.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:27.250
How that Dragon Spooker
girl destroyed my kingdom...

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.850
...and then that Monster
in the shape of a man...

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:33.450
I mean, how that Monster toyed with
my affections and broke my heart!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.220
Now I see the only person
I can depend on is myself!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.960
With my strength and the magic
of the monstrous Zoamelgustar...

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.130
...I will rebuild
the kingdom of Xoana!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.870
So, I don't paid for guiding
you till you get rich.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.500
Exactly...

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:54.740
And for that I need the
power of the Claire Bible!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.680
Now, if you understand, let's go!

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:01.750
Lina! I won't lose to you!

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:06.290
I'm not sure what you're talking
about, but don't give up, Miss!

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:18.830
So, Milgasia, is the place
with the Claire Bible very far?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:21.140
No. We'll be there soon.

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:26.440
By the way, human girl...

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:31.580
You know that Xellos is a Monster
and that he has some plot.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:33.810
Why do you still cooperate with him?

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:41.360
Well... So far, this looks like
it's the only path for us to follow.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:46.870
Of course I know that Hellmaster
doesn't want peace in this world...

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:51.870
...and maybe the guys trying
to kill me are right, but...

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:56.610
But as long as I don't
know the reasons for this...

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:59.670
...I can't just roll over and die.
I wasn't brought up that way.

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:03.340
One who lives
tries to keep on living.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:06.950
That's only natural.
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:15.860
I've been thinking about the
War of the Monsters' Fall.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.800
It happened a long time ago, right?

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.930
I believe it was one thousand
and twelve years ago, to be exact.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.470
What about it?

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.480
Xellos, you...

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:30.070
...are a really, REALLY
old man, aren't you?

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:34.470
Wha- What's brought this on?

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:37.640
Still, you look pretty young for a
one thousand twelve-year-old man!

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:40.520
Don't worry about your age!
Right, Xellos?

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.890
Uh, right. Thank you.

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:50.160
You really are very strange humans.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:55.760
I see now. With you involved, we
needn't fear the Monsters' plans.

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.770
Milgasia...

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.670
Try to see the
truth with your own eyes.

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.740
Then follow the
path you believe in.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:09.150
Then what you wish for will
come true, young lady.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:10.410
Right!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:13.250
Well, then. Shall we go?

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.380
Huh? You mean it's here?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.890
Where? Where's the Claire Bible?

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:25.060
It's this way!

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:32.910
The Claire Bible is in here.

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:36.300
You may pass normally through
what appears to you to be a cliff.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.240
Come here, Lina.

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.810
The rest of you must wait here.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.580
Hey! Why can only Lina go?!

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:49.180
You, too, may enter, but I won't
help you if you get trapped.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:56.490
Inside here is an endless labyrinth,
and only I know the way back!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:59.660
Either a Monster or
a dragon in human form...

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:04.170
...could spend their lives searching
for the way back if they don't know it.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.670
Yes, yes. I quite agree.

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:10.870
Hm... Well, then, I guess
we'll wait here for you, Lina.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:12.780
Get going and be careful!

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.610
Bring us back a souvenir!

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.950
Like there's gonna be any?

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:20.220
Well, shall we go?

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:36.870
Saygram!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:40.160
I won't let you go!
You will die here!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:45.840
Balus Wall!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:48.980
Astral Vine!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.410
Light, come forth!

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:04.190
I'll be the one you'll fight.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:08.430
Lina! Leave this to me
and get going inside!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.040
Hurry! Once we're inside...

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.480
...even a Monster will
have trouble following us!

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:19.040
Huh?! But...

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:21.810
Huh? Lina!

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.410
You won't get away!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.730
I've finally reached
the true Claire Bible.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:49.970
But with it now right in front
of me, Saygram has appeared!

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:52.850
Will Xellos be able to handle him?

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:57.550
And what truths are waiting
for me inside of this cliff?
